        "name": "avg_npc_1307_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel is defenseless, as the Regent said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1307_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep quiet. Stay alert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cautious Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stick to the original route and find the King. A Route and B Route, stand by.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cautious Assassin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1307_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their main force is not on the ship. They will need time to call for support.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel's guards still haven't noticed us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1307_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "His Highness was right. There is someone high up in the enemy's chain of command helping us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cautious Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "All units, enter the ship. We settle this quickly. Avoid anything unexpected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cautious Assassin"
    },
