    {
        "text": "Ten minutes ago, Amiya was roused by a strange sound."
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel is continually being maintained and renovated. It has already seen massive changes compared to when she first arrived at her new home."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Maybe Closure is busy fixing things again?'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor left Amiya many picture books in her room, with illustrated stories she had never heard of before."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her favorite is one that tells of someone who falls from the sky riding a fantastical vehicle, and the many adventures that come of it."
    },
    {
        "text": "But she is not fond of the ending. The hero repairs the vehicle and has to return to the sky, saying goodbye to the children on the ground."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#5$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I really don't like all this noise. The Doctor still isn't here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa... I need to go find Theresa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
