        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Mr. Downing! You dropped your pliers on the ground. Here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1308_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Amiya. Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to the Speaker's Office to find Theresa. Oh, right. Have you seen the Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1308_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor? It's been a few days. That one ought to be in the Command Center overseeing the operation, I think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew the Doctor must be busy with something... Okay. Bye-bye!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
