        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here, Amiya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard some loud noises that sounded really close... I got a little scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can go home soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look tired...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you like to stay with me while I work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this... a storybook?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. Well, as long as it's for you, I think I can take a short break. The Doctor and Dr. Kal'tsit won't mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1295_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Theresa!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, come sit over here. Once we finish this story, I'll take you to my homeland to play.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
