        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_410_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Merely some heirs making ridiculous comments on the situation. Nobody should be making light of that pair of siblings' lives or deaths at this moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duq'arael"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a grave disrespect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duq'arael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_410_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should you not be retreating and defending the inner city right now, Nezzsalem?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duq'arael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That has nothing to do with the war I am waiting for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_410_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresis asked you to come and ensure her death?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duq'arael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this not you being contemptuous of those siblings yourself? The Regent would not stoop to such methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am only here to witness the end of this war, and the beginning of another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the King of Sarkaz is struck down, I will bear the deathly pall of this moment. On behalf of the King, I will witness the victory I grasp from the abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_410_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you still feel sorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duq'arael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_420_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "As do you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
