    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": "un",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_dim_closeeye",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The black bubbles cut off all sound, just as they obscure Amiya's sight."
    },
    {
        "text": "Beyond the bubbles, Theresa's figure becomes more and more indistinct."
    },
    {
        "text": "Retreating further into the distance."
    },
    {
        "text": "There...sa...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay inside for now, Amiya. Sleep well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will be safe by my side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "un",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
