        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa. Your Highness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will use our lives as proof of the future that the General pursues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I was sighing about something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, there is no need to cover your face in front of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember you from back when you accepted Yli\u0161's orders before his chariot. Your heroism and valor in that battle moved me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember most of your fellows as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are all worthy of the title of 'brave warrior', in no way inferior to those heroes fighting in Kazdel this very moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1307_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We aren't covering our faces to hide our identities. We knew they would do nothing here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have cut off our horns, abandoned our names, even destroyed every inch of our skin that can be used to identify us. All so that after we use such wretched methods to kill the King of Sarkaz\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will not be remembered by the Sarkaz. We can't be remembered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Determined Assassin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
