    {
        "text": "The rushing air engulfs the assassins' blades like a swamp, as they incessantly stab forwards."
    },
    {
        "text": "Swoosh\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "The trembling of the blades causes the air surrounding them to resonate. They press on. They continue to stab."
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones holding the blades are buffeted and submerged by waves they cannot resist."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
