    {
        "text": "I remember your names.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember you. Luca.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You held back a Steam Knight on your own. You hid yourself within the steam to pull them out, and beheaded them before friend and foe.",
