    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember you too. Liens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the countless Sarkaz with that name, you are the one who stood out most. After being taken captive by Spire Casters, you freed three of your compatriots from their camp and destroyed their Arts Circle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
