    {
        "text": "Another death, and yet it cannot stop them from approaching Theresa."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then you. Levin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You took an arrow for Theresis, losing an arm in the process, but survived hell itself until you managed to retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not wish for you all to die nameless and unknown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the very least... I will remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
